          "id": "india-cyclone-murasu-2026-11-01",
          "headline": "Cyclone Murasu turns severe; landfall near Ongole expected tonight",
          "summary": "IMD has upgraded Murasu to a severe cyclonic storm with winds of 100 to 110 km/h, gusting to 120 km/h. It is expected to cross the south Andhra Pradesh coast between Nellore and Narsapur, near Ongole, from about 11:30 pm tonight to 4 am Tuesday. In Odisha, 19 districts are under yellow warnings and five southern districts face heavy to very heavy rain on Tuesday and Wednesday; Balimela reservoir gates have been opened as a precaution.",
          "why_it_matters": "Landfall tonight could damage homes, crops and ports along the east coast.",
          "importance": 5,
          "lead": true,
          "verified": true,
          "note": "Update: the storm is now rated severe and IMD has narrowed the landfall area and time.",
          "published_at": "2026-11-02T10:23:00+05:30",
