          "summary": "Thousands marched in New Delhi on Sunday in a rally led by Rahul Gandhi, demanding that Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar quit over the revision of voter rolls. Opposition parties say the revision wrongly removed a huge number of names; the Election Commission denies bias and says anyone wrongly removed can register again. Delhi Police put the crowd at about 50,000.",
