          "headline": "Sensex jumps about 1,000 points as Reliance surges on record profit",
          "summary": "By 11 am the Sensex was up 980 points (1.3%) at 75,439.94 and the Nifty up 276 points (1.2%). Reliance rose more than 6% after a record September-quarter profit of ₹29,550 crore, up 33.8%, led by its oil-to-chemicals business; retail was weaker. Foreign investors bought ₹3,599 crore of shares on Friday and Brent fell about 3%.",
